# 默认仅发布明确列出的用户文件。 / Publish only explicitly listed user-facing files.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!/ios_gpu_counter.py
!/requirements.txt
!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/USAGE.md
!/docs/OUTPUT_FORMAT.md
!/docs/TECHNICAL_GUIDE.md
!/docs/examples/
/docs/examples/*
!/docs/examples/sample.csv
!/docs/examples/sample.json
!/tools/
/tools/*
!/tools/recover_results.py

# 避免嵌套缓存被意外加入。 / Keep nested interpreter caches out of version control.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
